{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國當紅女團BLACK PINK成員Jisoo，今日心情靚爆現身首爾梨花女子大學，其代言國際奢侈品牌的高層於該大學獲頒榮譽博士學位，Jisoo身穿白恤衫配襯黑裙，以一身知性打扮到場，見證對方獲頒榮譽博士學位，她在台下興奮拍手歡呼，又用手機拍攝對方的高光時刻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:04:06.723039+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:47:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:37:41.648280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:17.275970+00:00","content_hash":"d0089267510a8f31a1d6d0b275120a249be69888bc7d06665b78e12ffce9f968","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:04:06.723039+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}